  npcName: Hunter
  _lines:
  - Hm...
  - You've got a keen eye.
  - I myself have been keeping an eye on her since the quarantine was put in place.
  - You never know if the devil is walking right next to you...
  - You want some advice?
  - Keep you head low.
  - If someone knocks, you don't answer.
  - Do that, and you'll be fine.
  - Let me do the hard work.
  - '*He hands you a pack of cigarettes*'
  - This should be enough company until everything blows over.
  _playerReplyOptions:
  - '*Take it*'
  - Investigate.
